      "height": 160,
      "style": {
        "width": 420,
        "height": 160
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "Note",
        "title": "API 614 LUBE OIL SYSTEM (LOS)",
        "text": "Demonstrates a heavy-duty API 614 lubrication oil system featuring redundant supply pumps (Main/Auxiliary), oil cooler heat exchanger, duplex filtration with dp monitoring, and pressure control (PRV/BPR) to ensure continuous oil delivery to high-speed turbomachinery bearings.",
        "fontSize": "md"
      }
    },
